GFX.Font distributes target-specific static artifacts built from FreeType and
HarfBuzz. It also distributes Noto Sans, Noto Sans Mono, Noto Emoji,
Noto Sans CJK SC, and Departure Mono assets and test fixtures derived from
those fonts, plus a Source Code Pro CFF
test fixture. The FreeType Project License, HarfBuzz license, Noto SIL Open
Font License, Departure Mono SIL Open Font License, and Source Code Pro SIL Open
Font License are kept in the Licenses directory.

Noto Emoji and Noto Sans CJK SC are licensed under the SIL Open Font License
1.1; the original copyright notices are retained in Licenses/NotoEmoji.txt
and Licenses/NotoCJK.txt. Asset source commits and SHA-256 hashes are recorded
in Assets/Fonts/PROVENANCE.json.
